    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzessp6ovc2t",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Regarding playing, composing, and practicing, which can be individualistic, that hits a different value proposition altogether: creativity and self-expression. \n\nAI generated music personally has not been satisfying to me on either basis. So much so that I chose to learn to play guitar.",
